      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Weights and Measures (Amendment) Bill 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1 ) This Act may be cited as the Weights and Measures (Amendment) Act 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 25 the following section: \"Custodian of Weights and Measures 25. (1) The National Measurement Standards Laboratory shall be the Custodian of Weights and Measures for the purposes of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act. (2) The Minister may, by regulations, prescribe the duties and powers of the Custodian.\". Amendment of section 25A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 25A the following section: \"Custodian to advise Minister 25A. The Custodian of Weights and Measures shall advise the Minister on all matters related to calibration, verification and testing of weights and measures or instruments for weighing or measuring and other matters related to metrology except the International System of Units and systems of measurement.\". Amendment of section 27A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 27A the following section: \"Institution of prosecution 27A. NO prosecution for or in relation to any offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor.\". Amendment of section 29"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 29(2) of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by deleting the words \"Malaysian Primary Standards, Secondary Standards, Tertiary Standards and\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b), by deleting the words \"Malaysian Primary Standards, Secondary Standards, Tertiary Standards and\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d), by deleting the words \"Malaysian Primary Standards, Secondary Standards, Tertiary Standards or\". Deletion of sections 33 and 34"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting sections 33 and 34. Amendment of section 34A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 34A the following section: \"Compounding of offences 34A. (1) The Chief Inspector may, with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor, offer to compound any offence under any provision of this Act or under regulations made under this Act by accepting from the person reasonably suspected of having committed the offence such amount of money not exceeding the maximum fine to which the person would have been liable if he had been convicted of the offence, within such time as may be specified in the offer. (2) An offer under subsection (1) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed and where the amount specified in the offer is not paid within the time specified in the offer or such extended time as the Chief Inspector may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at any time after that against the person to whom the offer was made. (3) Upon receipt of the amount under subsection ( 1) , no prosecution shall be instituted in respect of the offence against the person to whom the offer to compound was made.\". Deletion of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting the First"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule. Deletion of Third Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting the Third"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule. ."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of long title"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Weights and Measures Act 1972 [Act 71], which is referred to as \"the principal Act\" in this Act, is amended by substituting for the long title the following long title: \"An Act to regulate weights and measures and instruments for weighing and measuring and to make provisions for matters connected therewith.\". Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_i"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 2(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"instrument for weighing or measuring\" the following definition: ' \"instrument for weighing or measuring\" means any instrument or machine for measuring in terms of length, area, volume, capacity, time, weight, number or any other quantity, and in the case of an instrument for weighing, includes the weights used in connection therewith;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"Minister\" the following definition: \"National Measurement Standards Laboratory\" has the same meaning as is assigned to that expression in the National Measurement System Act 2007 [Act ];';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"Minister\" the following definition: \"Minister\" means the Minister responsible for domestic trade and consumer affairs;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"Custodian\", by substituting for the words \"appointed under\" the words \"referred to in\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"International System of Units\" the following definition: ' \"International System of Units\" has the same meaning as is assigned to that expression in the National Measurement System Act 2007;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"Minister\" the following definition: \"National Measurement Standards\" has the same meaning as is assigned to that expression in the National Measurement System Act 2007;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the definition of \"Secondary Standards\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the definition of \"Tertiary Standards\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
